    description: "The SF-T4400 is the Sunny treadmill most buyers have heard of, and the SF-T4400SMART is what Sunny sells under that number now. Sunny’s 5 November 2026 product page lists a 2.2 peak horsepower motor, speeds of 0.5 to 9 mph, three manual incline levels that its specification table gives as 0.2 to 2.9 degrees, a 285 lb maximum user weight and a 103.6 lb unit weight, and Academy Sports and Klarna list the same capacity. Two things need care. The deck appears on the same page as 49 by 16 inches in the description and 48.4 by 15.7 inches in the specification table, and Target’s listing for the older, non-SMART SF-T4400 still gives that model’s 220 lb rating. Make sure the model number on the listing ends in SMART before you rely on 285 lb. The warranty is three years on the frame and 180 days on other parts; see the warranty section for the motor. Sunny listed it at $449.99 on 5 November 2026.",
